      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "What is $(-2)^{-1}?$",
      "worked_solution": "The expression $(-2)^{-1}$ means the reciprocal of $-2.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n(-2)^{-1}=-\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$",
