      "worked_solution": "The expression ${(\\frac{2}{11})}^{-1}$ means the reciprocal of $\\frac{2}{11}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{2}{11})}^{-1}=\\frac{11}{2}.\n$$",
